$ exit 0
--- stdout
gh pj-synker <command> [options]
Add issues and pull requests to GitHub Projects

Commands:
  add     Add eligible issues and pull requests to a project
  init    Create a config file for the repository
  config  Inspect the config file
  help    Show help for a command

Global Options:
  -h, --help         Show help for a command
  --no-color         Turn off color
  --non-interactive  Never prompt; fail when input or confirmation is missing
  -v, --version      Print the version

Learn more: https://github.com/UtakataKyosui/gh-pj-synker#readme
